---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="One Take Wonder Marketing | Full-Service Marketing Agency"
  description="Full-service marketing agency with 10+ years of experience. Custom strategies built around your budget with proven ROI. TV, digital, creative, web design."
  canonical=""
>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="relative bg-gray-900 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background photo -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img src="/hero-banner.jpg" alt="Marketing team collaborating" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
  </div>
  <!-- Dark overlay for text readability -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gray-900/80"></div>
  <!-- Subtle pink accent overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-pink-dark/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-36">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-brand-pink-light font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">Full-Service Boutique Marketing Agency</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
        Marketing That <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">Proves Its Worth</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl">
        We don't just execute campaigns. We build customized marketing strategies that fit your budget and deliver measurable ROI because your marketing should work as hard as you do.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-center text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Let's chat!</a>
        <a href="tel:+13214838762" data-call-location="homepage-hero" class="btn-primary text-center text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Call (321) 483-8762</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES OVERVIEW -->
<section id="services" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">What We Do</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Everything Your Marketing Needs, <span class="gradient-text">All Under One Roof</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        From strategy to execution, creative to measurement — we offer every marketing service your business needs to grow, all managed by one dedicated team.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Strategy & Planning -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-brand-pink hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-pink/5 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-pink/20 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Strategy & Planning</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We build strategic marketing roadmaps designed to help your business grow with purpose and deliver measurable results — from brand strategy and market positioning to customized advertising placement aligned with your goals and budget.</p>
        <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mt-4">Marketing Strategy → Brand Identity → Market Research</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Media & Advertising -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-brand-pink hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-pink/5 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-pink/20 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Media & Advertising</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We place your message where your audience is most likely to see it and connect with it. We specialize in media planning and buying across TV (broadcast, cable, and streaming), radio, billboards, magazines, digital, paid search, and social media — helping you maximize reach, impact, and your budget.</p>
        <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mt-4">Media Buying → TV & Streaming → PPC → Social Ads</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Websites & Digital Marketing -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-brand-pink hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-pink/5 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-pink/20 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Websites & Digital Marketing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We create digital experiences designed to drive growth — from website design and development to SEO, SEM, and targeted display campaigns focused on increasing visibility and maximizing conversions. We also build automated email marketing strategies that nurture customer relationships at every stage of the journey.</p>
        <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mt-4">Web Design → SEO → SEM → Email Automation</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Creative & Content -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-brand-pink hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-pink/5 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-pink/20 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Creative & Content</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We bring ideas to life and create meaningful connections with your audience through strategic creativity and compelling storytelling. From concept development and visual design to copywriting, video production, content marketing, and professional print materials, we create content that captures attention and inspires action.</p>
        <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mt-4">Creative Direction → Content → Video → Print</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Brand & Audience -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-brand-pink hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-pink/5 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-pink/20 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Brand & Audience</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We build relationships that last — through strategic PR and media outreach, influencer partnerships, and memorable event marketing experiences that leave lasting impressions.</p>
        <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mt-4">Public Relations → Influencer Marketing → Events</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Measurement -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-brand-pink hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-pink/5 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-pink/20 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Analytics & Reporting</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">We believe every marketing decision should be measurable. We provide performance tracking, campaign reporting, dashboards, and insights that turn data into action — so you always know what's working.</p>
        <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mt-4">Performance Tracking → Dashboards → Actionable Insights</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">Explore All 22 Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW WE WORK -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">How We Work</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">A Process Built on <span class="gradient-text">Accountability</span></h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Every engagement follows a proven framework designed to deliver measurable results from day one.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-5">1</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Discover</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We learn your business, audience, goals, and budget — no cookie-cutter approaches.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-5">2</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Strategize</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We build a custom plan with the right channels, creative, and KPIs for your goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-5">3</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Execute</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We launch, monitor, and optimize campaigns across every channel — constantly improving.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-pink text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-5">4</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Prove ROI</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Clear reporting that connects every dollar spent to actual business results — no fluff.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY US -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Why One Take Wonder</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading mb-6">Over a Decade of <span class="gradient-text">Proven Results</span></h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          For more than 10 years, One Take Wonder Marketing has been the trusted marketing partner for local businesses looking to grow with purpose and measurable results. As a boutique agency, you'll never be passed to a salesperson — your first point of contact is our founder, Palloma Earl, who remains personally involved in every client relationship and campaign.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Alongside a dedicated team of strategists, creatives, and media buyers, Palloma leads the planning, direction, and execution of every project to ensure personalized service and exceptional results. We work as an extension of your team — delivering agency expertise with the attention and collaboration of an in-house marketing department.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Customized to Your Budget</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">We don't believe in one-size-fits-all packages. Every strategy is custom-built around your goals, your market, and what makes sense for your investment. We provide thoughtful recommendations based on your business objectives and annual revenue, along with guidance on ideal investment levels to help each marketing channel perform effectively and deliver meaningful results.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Always Focused on ROI</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Every campaign we create is tied to measurable outcomes. From awareness and engagement to leads and sales, we track performance so you always understand what your marketing investment is delivering.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Full-Service, Beyond Digital</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">From TV commercials and print advertising to streaming campaigns, social media, websites, billboards, and content creation — we offer a complete marketing solution designed to keep your brand consistent, connected, and growing across every channel.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-10 text-white">
        <p class="text-brand-pink-light font-medium text-lg mb-4">The One Take Wonder Difference</p>
        <blockquote class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
          "Your marketing should feel aligned, intentional, and effective. We build systems that grow with your business — and we prove they work."
        </blockquote>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white">OT</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold">Palloma Earl</p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Founder, One Take Wonder Marketing</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-gray-900">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">
      Ready to See What Marketing <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">That Proves ROI</span> Can Do?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10">
      Let's talk about your goals. We'll put together a free, no-obligation proposal tailored to your budget and objectives.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Let's chat!</a>
      <a href="mailto:pearl@onetakewonderproductions.com" class="btn-outline-light text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Email Us Directly</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
